CHAPTER FOUR 
MANNER OF VAT COLLECTION 
Part-A: On Imports 
27. Manner  of  
VAT  collection  on  taxable  imports.—The  Commissioner  of  
Customs  or  the  Customs  Officer  shall  collect  VAT  on  the  taxable  imports  in  the  same  
manner  and  at  the  same  time  as    he  collects  customs  duty  on  such  imports  under  the  
Customs Act even if import duty is not imposable on such import.  
28. Determination  of  value  of  taxable  imports.—The  value  of  a  taxable  
import shall be the summation of the following amounts‚ namely:— 
(a) the value of the goods determined for the imposition of import duty  
