(b) the  amounts,  if  any,  of  customs  duty,  supplementary  duty,  or  other  
taxes  (other  than  
VAT  and  advance  income  tax)  payable  on  the  
import of the goods.  
29. Determination  of  value  of  re-imported  goods.—Where  goods  are  re-
