the  expenses  incurred  on  their  insurance,  freight  and  landing  charges  provided  that  the  
forms,   features,   characteristics   and   the   qualitative   standards   of   the   goods   remain 
unchanged after such repairs. 
30. Imports for exports.—A good brought for export, without being released 
for consumption inside Bangladesh, shall not be liable to any tax.   
